Description: Accesses and standardizes terrestrial monitoring data and
    calculates indicators used by the Bureau of Land Management Assessment,
    Inventory, and Monitoring program and Landscape Monitoring Framework, and
    the Natural Resources Conservation Service National Resources Inventory.
    Methods are described in McCord et al. (2022)
    <doi:10.1016/j.ecolind.2022.109511>.
